Maintainer: CodeDev by Edward
Homepage: https://myportfoliohub.online/
Description: IsoDock bootable USB manager for Linux
 IsoDock provides a compact native GTK3 interface for installing and updating
 multiboot USB drives. It is powered by the Ventoy 1.1.17 open-source
 engine with independent Linux packaging, IsoDock desktop branding, integrity
 diagnostics, and an IsoDock boot-menu theme.
